{"seq":1,"slug":"voice-leading-principles","title":"声部连接原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/voice-leading-principles","wordCount":1456,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"声部连接原则\">声部连接原则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>声部连接研究的是&quot;从一个和弦走到下一个和弦时，四个声部各自怎么移动&quot;。它以四部和声为标准载体，围绕一组优先级原则展开：共同音保持、最近距离进行、外声部反向，以及倾向音（导音、七音、增减音程）的定向解决。这些原则共同追求的目标是声部独立与平滑——避免无谓大跳，同时让每个声部都像一条有意义的线。后文的声部间距、解决规则、开放/密集排列与重复音选择，都是这套原则的展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四部和声的基本框架\">四部和声的基本框架</h2><p>四部和声（Four-Part Harmony）是和声学教学中的标准载体，使用四个声部模拟合唱团的音域分配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>声部</th>\n<th>音域范围</th>\n<th>功能角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>女高音 (Soprano)</td>\n<td>C4 - G5</td>\n<td>旋律声部，最易被听见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>女低音 (Alto)</td>\n<td>F3 - D5</td>\n<td>内声部填充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>男高音 (Tenor)</td>\n<td>C3 - A4</td>\n<td>内声部填充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>男低音 (Bass)</td>\n<td>E2 - D4</td>\n<td>和声基础，决定转位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>声部间距规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>相邻高声部（S-A、A-T）间距不超过八度</li>\n<li>男高音与男低音间距可超过八度</li>\n<li>声部不交叉（低声部不高于上方声部的音）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;四部和声框架&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Soprano&lt;br/&gt;旋律 + 最高音&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Alto&lt;br/&gt;内声部(上)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Tenor&lt;br/&gt;内声部(下)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Bass&lt;br/&gt;低音 + 转位基准&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;S-A 间距不超过八度&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;A-T 间距不超过八度&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;T-B 间距可超过八度&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"四部和声框架\"] --&gt; B[\"Soprano&lt;br/&gt;旋律 + 最高音\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Alto&lt;br/&gt;内声部(上)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Tenor&lt;br/&gt;内声部(下)\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Bass&lt;br/&gt;低音 + 转位基准\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"S-A 间距不超过八度\"]\n    C --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"A-T 间距不超过八度\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"T-B 间距可超过八度\"]</pre><h2 id=\"声部连接的核心原则\">声部连接的核心原则</h2><p>当从一个和弦进行到下一个和弦时，四个声部各自的移动方式应遵循以下优先级原则：</p>\n<p><strong>原则一：共同音保持</strong>（Common Tone Retention）如果两个相邻和弦有共同音，该音应尽量保留在同一声部不动。这是最平滑的连接方式。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>共同音 G 保持不动</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\to G: \\quad \\text{共同音 G 保持不动}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">共同音</span><span class=\"mord\"> G </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">保持不动</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>原则二：最近距离进行</strong>（Nearest Tone）非共同音应以最短的路径（级进或小跳）移向新和弦中最近的目标音。避免不必要的大跳。</p>\n<p><strong>原则三：反向进行</strong>（Contrary Motion）外声部（Soprano 与 Bass）应尽量反向运动——当低音下行时，高音上行，反之亦然。这增加了声部的独立性与对比感。</p>\n<p><strong>原则四：特殊倾向音的解决</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>导音（VII级）→ 强烈上行解决到主音</li>\n<li>七和弦的七音 → 强烈下行级进解决</li>\n<li>增四度/减五度 → 反向解决（收缩或扩张）</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>进行类型</th>\n<th>共同音数量</th>\n<th>连接策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上/下四五度</td>\n<td>1个</td>\n<td>保持共同音，其余级进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上/下三度</td>\n<td>2个</td>\n<td>保持两个共同音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上/下二度</td>\n<td>0个</td>\n<td>全部声部反向/斜向进行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"导音与七音的解决\">导音与七音的解决</h2><p>导音（Leading Tone）是调式中第七级音（在大调中距主音仅半音），具有最强的上行解决倾向：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>导音</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>半音上行</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>主音</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{导音} \\xrightarrow{\\text{半音上行}} \\text{主音}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">导音</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">半音上行</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主音</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 V → I 的进行中，包含导音的声部<strong>必须</strong>上行解决到主音。唯一例外是当导音位于内声部（Alto 或 Tenor）且紧接着的和弦为完整的主和弦时，导音可以下行三度到五音以保证和弦完整性。</p>\n<p>七和弦中的七音具有下行解决倾向：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>七音</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>级进下行</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>下方级进目标</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{七音} \\xrightarrow{\\text{级进下行}} \\text{下方级进目标}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">七音</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">级进下行</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下方级进目标</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如在 G7 → C 的进行中，G7 的七音 F 必须下行解决到 C 和弦的三音 E。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 解决[&quot;V7 到 I 的声部解决&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;B 导音 到 C 主音&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;F 七音 到 E 三音&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;D 五音 到 C 或 E&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;G 根音 到 C 根音&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 解决[\"V7 到 I 的声部解决\"]\n        A[\"B 导音 到 C 主音\"]\n        B[\"F 七音 到 E 三音\"]\n        C[\"D 五音 到 C 或 E\"]\n        D[\"G 根音 到 C 根音\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"开放排列与密集排列\">开放排列与密集排列</h2><p>和弦的纵向排列方式影响音响效果：</p>\n<p><strong>密集排列</strong>（Close Position）：三个上方声部在一个八度以内。音响紧密、集中。</p>\n<p><strong>开放排列</strong>（Open Position）：三个上方声部超出一个八度。音响宽广、透明。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C大三和弦密集排列：</mtext><munder><munder><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Bass</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>&lt; 八度</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C大三和弦密集排列：} \\underbrace{C}_{\\text{Bass}} - \\underbrace{E - G - C&#x27;}_{\\text{&lt; 八度}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大三和弦密集排列：</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Bass</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2389em;vertical-align:-1.437em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5903em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">&lt; </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">八度</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.2687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"