n class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2389em;vertical-align:-1.437em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5903em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">&gt; </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">八度</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.2687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7313em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.437em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>选择开放还是密集排列通常基于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>旋律位置（Soprano 的音高决定了排列倾向）</li>\n<li>前后和弦的连接平滑性</li>\n<li>音响风格需求（管弦乐倾向开放，合唱可两者兼用）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"和弦重复音的选择\">和弦重复音的选择</h2><p>三和弦有三个音但需要填充四个声部，因此必须重复某个音。重复音的选择原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>重复音</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>根音</td>\n<td>强化和弦身份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次选</td>\n<td>五音</td>\n<td>中性，不改变色彩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免</td>\n<td>三音</td>\n<td>加重大/小色彩，改变平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对禁止</td>\n<td>导音</td>\n<td>导音重复会模糊解决方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>特殊情况：减三和弦（vii°）通常重复三音而非根音——因为减三和弦的根音是导音，重复导音违反上述禁忌。</p>\n<p>在七和弦中，四个音正好填满四个声部，无需重复。但属七和弦解决到主和弦时，若导音与七音都要正确解决，主和弦可能缺少五音——这是被允许的&quot;不完整主和弦&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四部和声以合唱音域分配四声部，相邻高声部间距不超过八度、声部不交叉。</li>\n<li>连接四原则：共同音保持、最近距离进行、外声部反向、倾向音定向解决。</li>\n<li>导音必须上行解决到主音，七音必须下行级进解决。</li>\n<li>排列分密集与开放两种，选择取决于旋律位置与前后连接。</li>\n<li>三和弦需重复一个音填满四声部，优先重复根音、绝对禁止重复导音。</li>\n<li>减三和弦例外——重复三音而非根音。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>声部连接的对象是各和弦及其转位，回顾和弦构成与转位标记：<a href=\"../chord-construction/triads\">三和弦的构成与分类</a></li>\n<li>导音上行、七音下行的解决规则承接属七和弦的张力分析：<a href=\"../chord-construction/seventh-chords\">七和弦体系</a></li>\n<li>平行五度/八度禁忌是声部连接的反面约束，专章展开：<a href=\"parallel-prohibition\">平行运动禁忌与对位基础</a></li>\n<li>四部和声原则在管弦配器中扩展为多声部排列实践：<a href=\"../../arrangement-orchestration/texture-voicing/harmonic-voicing-voice-leading\">和声配置与声部连接</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"声部连接原则","id":"声部连接原则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四部和声的基本框架","id":"四部和声的基本框架"},{"level":2,"text":"声部连接的核心原则","id":"声部连接的核心原则"},{"level":2,"text":"导音与七音的解决","id":"导音与七音的解决"},{"level":2,"text":"开放排列与密集排列","id":"开放排列与密集排列"},{"level":2,"text":"和弦重复音的选择","id":"和弦重复音的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"和声节奏与曲式结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/harmonic-rhythm"},"next":{"title":"平行运动禁忌与对位基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/parallel-prohibition"}}